{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalSimpleSpectrum","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalSimpleSpectrum","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.QJucysMurphyEigen","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SytContentTuple"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.seminormalRep_qJM_spectrum_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.seminormalRep_qJM_spectrum_injective","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalSimpleSpectrum.lean#L61-L82","doc":"**The `q`-Jucys–Murphy spectrum is simple.**  A tableau is determined by its tuple of\n`L_k`-eigenvalues in the seminormal representation.\n\nThis is what makes the diagonalisation of `seminormalRep_qJM` *useful*: the joint eigenspaces of\nthe commuting family `{L_0, …, L_n}` are single coordinate lines, so every subspace invariant\nunder the family is spanned by a subset of the SYT basis. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.seminormalRep_qJM_diag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.seminormalRep_qJM_diag","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalSimpleSpectrum.lean#L54-L59","doc":"The diagonal entry of `ρ(L_k)` at `T` is `q^{2·content}` at the cell holding `k+1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.zpow_injective_of_not_root_of_unity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.zpow_injective_of_not_root_of_unity","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalSimpleSpectrum.lean#L45-L52","doc":"**Equal powers force equal exponents**, for a real `q` that is not a root of unity.\n`q ≠ 0` with `q ^ 2 ≠ 1` says exactly that over `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}